--[[
================================================================================
  EggESP.lua  —  Ride A Pet · Egg Scanner + Info + ESP   (STANDALONE)
================================================================================
  A self-contained client tool that:
    • Lists every egg CURRENTLY SPAWNING in the map (live), with its
      rarity, sell price, luck, growth time, weight, mutation and distance.
    • Shows a full Egg Index (all eggs in the game with their stats).
    • Draws ESP over each active egg: a through-wall billboard (name / rarity /
      $price / luck / distance) and an optional coloured marker dot.
    • WARP: teleport to the nearest / rarest egg, or per egg-type.
    • HOME: teleport back to your own plot — including automatically the moment
      you pick up (hold) an egg, so you can drop it straight into a nest.
    • NOCLIP: walk through walls (clears collision on your own character only).

  The ESP/info part is READ-ONLY (never fires a remote). The WARP/HOME/NOCLIP
  part moves / affects ONLY YOUR OWN character locally (CFrame / PivotTo /
  CanCollide) — it still fires no remotes, but the server may snap you back or
  block you if it validates movement/collision. Use on a private/authorised
  server.

  --------------------------------------------------------------------------
  HOW TO RUN (executor):
      loadstring(readfile("TestScript/EggESP.lua"))()
  or just paste the whole file into your executor and run it.

  KEYS:  Right-Alt = show/hide window · G = warp to nearest egg · H = warp home
         · N = toggle noclip  (G/H/N must be enabled in Settings first).

  DATA SOURCES (auto-detected, all read-only):
    • ReplicatedStorage.GameData.Eggs                → egg stats (rarity/price/luck…)
    • (ServerData|ReplicatedStorage).ActiveEggs      → live spawned-egg markers
        each child has attributes: Egg, Position, Weight, Mutation, PrivateTo …
================================================================================
--]]

